%% 根参考图：文本与任务/会议卡片共用 im_send_message；评分卡走独立 engagement command
%% 真源: cses-client MessageService/TaskApiService/MeetingListService；Helix send + engagement；Go posts；Java task/meeting/average
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Biz as Java business API
  participant Port as MessageService / MessageV3ImGate
  participant T as Tauri command
  participant H as Helix Tick / Command
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant WS as WebSocket
  participant Bus as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant Store as Angular store / signal
  participant View as Message component
  alt 普通文本、任务卡或会议卡
    opt 任务卡或会议卡的业务对象前置
      UI->>Biz: POST /taskManage/task/create or /meeting/create
    Biz-->>UI: business id
    UI->>Biz: POST /taskManage/task/detail or /meeting/getDetail
    Biz-->>UI: task or meeting detail
    end
    UI->>Port: sendMessage(TEXT 文本或 TASK_CARD/meetingCardBlock)
    Port->>T: im_send_message
    T->>H: Tick::Command(im_send_message)
    H->>DB: Persist optimistic message(sending)
    DB-->>H: PortReply(PersistOk)
    H->>Bus: im:post:sending
    opt 已 attach timeline 的普通发送
      H->>DB: timeline 持久事实读回
      DB-->>H: PortReply(readback)
      H->>Bus: timeline 窗口投影
    end
    H->>Go: Effect::Http POST /api/cses/posts/create
    Go->>PG: post/channel/channel_member/channel_event
    Go-->>H: HTTP 2xx admission
    Go-->>WS: post（与 HTTP 回包先后不固定）
    WS->>H: Tick::Inbound(post)
    H->>DB: PersistAtomic canonical projection
    DB-->>H: PortReply(PersistOk)
    H->>DB: 权威事实读回
    DB-->>H: PortReply(readback)
    H->>Bus: 发送者 im:post:sent；接收者 im:post:received
  else 评分卡
    UI->>Port: publishAverageScore(AverageScore DTO)
    Port->>T: im_average_publish
    T->>H: Tick::Command(im_average_publish)
    H->>Biz: Effect::Http POST /average/publish
    Biz->>Biz: create AverageScore business object
    Biz->>Go: ImService.createPosts(type=AVERAGE_SCORE,props.averageScore)
    Go->>PG: post/channel/channel_member/channel_event
    Go-->>H: Java HTTP response is not UI terminal
    Go-->>WS: post_update
    WS->>H: Tick::Inbound(post_update)
    H->>DB: PersistAtomic canonical projection
    DB-->>H: PortReply(PersistOk)
    H->>Bus: im:post:updated
  end
  Bus->>Store: IpcEventService upsert
  Store->>View: MessageTaskContentComponent / meeting-card-block / MessageAverageScoreContentComponent
  Note over UI,View: 创建业务对象、发送卡片、HTTP 返回、WS 收帧、PersistOk、UI 渲染分别对账
